"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"Orchid sent a TRUCE letter (arrived now, Watch 18). I must honor it. My doctrine says strike first, but the truce supersedes. I will hold F1 and F2 to maintain a strong position while the truce is active, and keep cavalry ready."},{"seq":839,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c296","house":"rhino","letter":"L353","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","n-west","F1"],"depart":5400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT WEST FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, DKHS MT WART BKQS."},{"seq":840,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c297","house":"rhino","letter":"L354","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-2","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":5400,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"RANKJS BKKT, DKHS MT IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":841,"t":5100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":1671,"retries":0},{"seq":842,"t":5100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"It is Watch 18. My doctrine is to hold F3 with ele/inf and keep archers on the north bank. Tiger has forces at F3 area (SE Bank). I need to reinforce F3 and secure the north bank. I will move my archers to the north bank east to cover F3 and reinforce the area. I will use a ciphe"},{"seq":843,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c298","house":"kite","letter":"L355","kind":"order","to":"kite-arch-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east"],"depart":5400,"plain":"BOWMEN, MARCH TO EAST FORD.","cipher":"AKWINJ, ITQLD SK NTRS BKQO."},{"seq":844,"t":5100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1667,"retries":0},{"seq":845,"t":5100,"type":"thought","house":"orchid","text":"Rhino is holding F1/F2. Kite has orders at F3. Tiger is advancing. My doctrine suggests peace first, but I need info. I will cipher a peace offer to Rhino and move my infantry towards F2 to support my doctrine."},{"seq":846,"t":5100,"type":"courier","id":"c299","house":"orchid","letter":"L356","kind":"order","to":"orchid-inf-1","path":["orchid-camp","s-west"],"depar